Z||000008||8Ball||07-05-2001||09:45 PM||||Figures  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> I did so searching myself and turned up basically nothing liveable for less than 2 grand a month!!!! Jesh what to they think we are made of money???? <BR>Here let me give you my left arm for rent  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>On the upside I found another job here in TN just incase I can't move to TO. Now if I could just get the money together to buy a fiero (or at this point any auto to replace my dearly departed. (died at the hands of the worst little old lady driver I have ever seen)<P>Stupid lady pulled out right in front of me while I was doing 70 on the highway right after being laid off from my job  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> No more 525 hp 81 Monte Carlo<P>Any way I would just like to say ppl in To want WAAAAAY too much money for rent. My brother in law pays almost 100 grand a year for his condo there !!! Must be nice  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>8ball||||reg||1
